   170	
   171	The support census uses the canonical TRAIN partition and exact frozen TLE file
   172	set SHA-256
   173	`427e6a91774b0ebf3d9b5a13dd783fdaa3f107666f9e9a6cb2a08d5c92b38fe9`.
