   179	
   180	The checkpoint is greedy, detached, and never updated. The three fixed
   181	`(environment seed, mobility seed)` pairs are:
   182	
   183	1. `(2026082811, 2026082821)`;
   184	2. `(2026082812, 2026082822)`;
   185	3. `(2026082813, 2026082823)`.
   186	
   187	Each pair runs ten independently reset episodes of ten logical steps, for 300
   188	logical steps total. The frozen Main action is executed only to advance the
   189	canonical state. Reward and successor outcome are not inputs to either support
   190	predicate or to the threshold.
   191	
   192	The a-priori premise floor is the same for both roles:
   193	
   194	- `C2`: at least 10% of the 300 logical steps expose at least one support of
   195	  size two or greater;
   196	- `C3`: at least 10% of the 300 logical steps expose at least one support of
   197	  size two or greater.
   198	
   199	Thus each role requires at least 30 exposed logical steps. The floor is fixed
   200	before seeing census counts and must not be relaxed after failure. `C1` is
   201	scheduled every step and is outside this premise census.
