    53	@dataclass(frozen=True)
    54	class TrainerEnvironmentConfig:
    55	    """Exactly the two fields ``MODQNTrainer`` reads off ``env.config``.
    56	
    57	    Deliberately **not** ``StepConfig``, which used to hold these plus
    58	    ``phi1``/``phi2``, the mobility model and the mask mode — every one of
    59	    which now has an owner elsewhere.  A second home for a frozen value is
    60	    how the two drift apart, so this carries the two the trainer actually
