   154	    candidate fields by ``TrainerConfig.r1_reward_mode``, and the live one
   155	    was ``r1_throughput``, whose name then contradicted the value the
   156	    environment was putting in it.  A field named "throughput" holding
   157	    bits/J is exactly the silent mismatch the rest of this project keeps
